===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|en|enm|eft}}, from {{inh|en|ang|eft}}, {{m|ang|æft}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*afti}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*afti}}. Cognate with {{cog|osx|eft}}, {{m|osx|aft}}, {{m|osx|eht|t=again, afterwards}}, {{cog|gml|echt|t=again, afterward}}. Compare {{m+|en|after}}, {{m|en|aft}}.

====Adverb====
{{en-adv|-}}

# {{lb|en|obsolete}} [[again|Again]]; [[afterwards]]
